<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<section xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="fs-id1170655150800" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID"><title>Nggunakake Variabel lan Simbol Aljabar</title><para id="fs-id1170654982105">Upamane dibutuhake asil ping-pingan saka sangang faktor sing saben-saben padha karo 2. Iki bisa ditulis minangka <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Panulisan iki repot lan cacah angka 2 angel dilacak, mula digunakake eksponen. Wujud <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> bisa ditulis minangka <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> bisa ditulis minangka <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Ing ekspresi kaya <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> angka 2 diarani <emphasis effect="italics">wilangan pokok (basis)</emphasis> lan angka 3 diarani <emphasis effect="italics">eksponen</emphasis>. Eksponen nuduhake cacah faktor sing saben-saben padha karo wilangan pokok.</para>
<media id="fs-id1170655219218" alt="Angka loro ditampilake kanthi angka telu minangka superskrip ing sisih tengen ndhuwur. Sawijining panah nuding angka loro lan diwenehi label “wilangan pokok”, dene panah liyane nuding angka telu minangka superskrip lan diwenehi label “eksponen”. Tegese, gawea asil ping-pingan saka telung faktor sing saben-saben padha karo 2, yaiku 2 ping 2 ping 2.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_003_img_new.jpg" />
</media>
<para id="fs-id1166420392829">Wujud <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> diwaca “loro pangkat telu” utawa “loro kubik”.</para>
<para id="fs-id1170654953415">Wujud <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> ditulis nganggo <emphasis effect="italics">notasi pangkat</emphasis> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ditulis nganggo <emphasis effect="italics">notasi dawa</emphasis>.</para>
<note id="fs-id1170655107718">
<title>Notasi Pangkat</title>
<para id="fs-id1170655213989"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>n</m:mi></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> yaiku asil ping-pingan saka faktor-faktor sing saben-saben padha karo <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis>, kanthi cacah faktor <emphasis effect="italics">n</emphasis>, kanggo n sing arupa wilangan bulat positif.</para>
<media id="fs-id1170655111941" alt="a ditampilake kanthi n minangka superskrip ing sisih tengen ndhuwur. Sawijining panah nuding a lan diwenehi label “wilangan pokok”, dene panah liyane nuding n minangka superskrip lan diwenehi label “eksponen”. Ing ngisore katulis persamaan a superskrip n padha karo a ping a ping a ping elipsis ping a, sing nuduhake ping-pingan faktor a kanthi cacah n; nilai n durung ditemtokake. Sawijining tandha kurung digambar ing ngisor faktor-faktor a kasebut lan diwenehi label “n faktor”.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_004_img_new.jpg" />
</media>
<para id="fs-id1170655228836">Ekspresi <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>n</m:mi></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> diwaca <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> pangkat <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>n</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170654937018">Senajan <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>n</m:mi></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> diwaca “<emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> pangkat <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>n</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>”, lumrahe diwaca:</para>
<list id="fs-id1166424875923" list-type="bulleted" bullet-style="bullet">
<item><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> “<emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> kuadrat”</item>
<item><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> “<emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> kubik”</item>
</list>
<para id="fs-id1170655195218">Mengko bakal dirembug apa sebabe <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> nduweni jeneng mligi.</para>
<para id="fs-id1170655112606"><link target-id="fs-id1170654954100" /> nuduhake carane maca sawetara ekspresi sing ngemot eksponen.</para>
<table id="fs-id1170654954100" aria-label="Tabel iki nduweni limang larik lan rong kolom. Larik kapisan ngemot irah-irahan saben kolom. Kolom kapisan diwenehi label &quot;Ekspresi&quot; lan kolom kapindho &quot;Kanthi Tetembungan&quot;. Larik kapindho ngemot 7 superskrip 2 ing kolom kapisan lan frasa &quot;7 pangkat loro utawa 7 kuadrat&quot; ing kolom kapindho. Larik sabanjure ngemot 5 superskrip 3 ing kolom kapisan lan frasa &quot;5 pangkat telu utawa 5 kubik&quot; ing kolom kapindho. Larik sabanjure ngemot 9 superskrip 4 ing kolom kapisan lan frasa &quot;9 pangkat papat&quot; ing kolom kapindho. Larik pungkasan ngemot 12 superskrip 5 ing kolom kapisan lan frasa &quot;12 pangkat lima&quot; ing kolom kapindho.">
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" />
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" />
<thead>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center" valign="top">Ekspresi</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">Kanthi Tetembungan</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">7 pangkat loro utawa 7 kuadrat</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">5 pangkat telu utawa 5 kubik</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">9 pangkat papat</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> pangkat lima</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<example id="fs-id1170655121051"><exercise id="fs-id1170655121053">
<problem id="fs-id1170654954435">
<para id="fs-id1170654954437">Gawea luwih prasaja: <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655003298">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<table id="eip-958" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Cara nemtokake nilai ekspresi pangkat 3^4 kanthi langkah mbaka langkah.">
<tgroup cols="2"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry> </entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:msup><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msup></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Tulisen ekspresi minangka ping-pingan faktor-faktore.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Pingake saka kiwa menyang tengen.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Pingake.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mn>27</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Pingake.</entry>
    <entry>81</entry>
  </row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</solution>
</exercise>
</example><note id="fs-id1170655196165" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655197165">
<problem id="fs-id1170655197167">
<para id="fs-id1170655102365">Gawea luwih prasaja: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654954209">
<para id="fs-id1170654954211"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 125 <span class="token">ⓑ</span> 1</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170655102894" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655194687">
<problem id="fs-id1170655194690">
<para id="fs-id1170655025314">Gawea luwih prasaja: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655114557">
<para id="fs-id1170655114560"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 49 <span class="token">ⓑ</span> 0</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
</section>
